Margaye Saqqaye haram haye haye,<br>
Sheh ki kamar hogayi qam haye haye.<br>
<br>
Neher pe Abbas ke shane kate,<br>
Lut gaye Sultane umam haye haye.<br>
<br>
Gham se kamar toot gayi Shah ki,<br>
Uth nahi sakte hain qadam haye haye.<br>
<br>
Sar bhi Alamdar ka shaq hogaya,<br>
Hogaye bazu bhi qalam haye haye.<br>
<br>
Mit gaya ab fouje Khuda ka nishan,<br>
Khoon mein duba hai alam haye haye.<br>
<br>
Kehte the Sheh bhai ke shaida utho,<br>
Ghere hain sab ahle sitam haye haye.